{
  "format": "winlove.catalog.settings",
  "version": 1,
  "_comment": "P12 Ayarlar / Tweaks form. tab > section > setting. A toggle has two states; 'default' is what Windows does on its own (nothing is written) and 'writes' / 'services' belong to the other state. A dropdown / radio lists 'options'; the one without writes or services is the Windows default. apply=firstLogon: also re-applied after setup (D-026). recommended: what 'Önerilenleri uygula' picks (toggle: true = the non-default state; dropdown / radio: an option id). Writes that also exist in tweaks.json use the same values and the same apply mode, so P11 and P12 show the same queue.",
  "tabs": [
